  "description": "Unofficial MCP server for Polish public registers: company lookup (KRS + VAT whitelist), the optional GUS REGON register (needs your own GUS key), bank-account whitelist checks, cadastral parcel lookup and address geocoding (GUGiK ULDK and UUG), real-estate transaction prices (RCN, GUGiK), local statistics (GUS Bank Danych Lokalnych, no key), and offline validation of NIP, REGON, KRS, NRB and KW numbers. Not affiliated with the Polish government. Run: dotnet dnx PolishOpenData.Mcp --yes",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
